# Font credits

All fonts bundled here are open source and licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, which permits use, modification, and redistribution (including in this repo) as long as the license text travels with the font. Each font's full license is included alongside it.

| Font | File(s) | Designer / Foundry | License |
|---|---|---|---|
| [Space Grotesk](https://github.com/floriankarsten/space-grotesk) | `SpaceGrotesk.ttf` | Florian Karsten | [OFL 1.1](./OFL-SpaceGrotesk.txt) |
| [DM Sans](https://github.com/googlefonts/dm-fonts) | `DMSans.ttf` | Colophon Foundry, commissioned by Google Fonts | [OFL 1.1](./OFL-DMSans.txt) |
| [IBM Plex Mono](https://github.com/IBM/plex) | `IBMPlexMono-Regular.ttf`, `IBMPlexMono-Medium.ttf`, `IBMPlexMono-SemiBold.ttf` | IBM, designed by Mike Abbink / Bold Monday | [OFL 1.1](./OFL-IBMPlexMono.txt) |

Source files pulled from the [Google Fonts GitHub repository](https://github.com/google/fonts) (`ofl/` directory).

Space Grotesk and DM Sans are variable fonts, so a single file covers their full weight range. IBM Plex Mono ships as static weights, so only the three weights actually used in the app (Regular, Medium, SemiBold) are included to keep the repo lean.
